00:36:00,922 --> 00:36:02,082
minutes for eight years.

444
00:36:05,545 --> 00:36:07,987
All these political artists, what were they doing?

445
00:36:08,007 --> 00:36:12,450
They were falling all over themselves to get into galleries with their bullshit

446
00:36:13,150 --> 00:36:13,911
wallpaper.

447
00:36:14,691 --> 00:36:19,369
And so it's like, you know what, you had an opportunity to show that you really spoke against

