00:37:35,848 --> 00:37:38,969
There are a lot of dangers to putting work up in public without permission.

466
00:37:39,009 --> 00:37:39,829
I've been arrested 18 times.

467
00:37:45,202 --> 00:37:46,603
Being arrested is never fun.

468
00:37:46,943 --> 00:37:47,164
It's

