for me to take that risk.

474
00:38:04,798 --> 00:38:08,101
It interacts with people where they live their daily lives.

475
00:38:12,908 --> 00:38:17,450
You know, what I'm trying to do is I'm trying to use the tools that propaganda uses.

476
00:38:18,311 --> 00:38:20,092
And I even call my work propaganda.

477
00:38:20,552 --> 00:38:23,433
Propaganda has a negative connotation, but I don't think it has to be negative.

478
00:38:23,453 --> 00:38:26,395
So I'm using the tools of propaganda in a way that I think is

479
00:38:27,155 --> 00:38:28,196
socially responsible.

480
00:38:35,619 --> 00:38:40,702
The Obama hope poster was like, you know, lightning in a bottle, perfect storm.

481
00:38:42,318 --> 00:38:44,359
I created the Hope poster as

