The campaign, the Obama campaign, reached out to me and said, we really like that, but would

488
00:39:08,730 --> 00:39:09,170
you mind

489
00:39:09,911 --> 00:39:12,032
using the word hope or change?

490
00:39:12,872 --> 00:39:13,012
And

491
00:39:13,773 --> 00:39:18,415
I like the word hope because I think during Bush, a lot of people felt hopeless.

492
00:39:19,176 --> 00:39:21,337
And without hope, people don't act.

493
00:39:25,105 --> 00:39:30,271
The Obama branding was excellent, his logo, the type choices they made, but there hadn't been

494
00:39:30,331 --> 00:39:32,553
anything with that human connection.

495
00:39:32,753 --> 00:39:38,359
And I'd like to think that beyond just the human connection, that the way in which I illustrated

